<section id="contact" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>
    <div class="contact-content">
      <div class="contact-text">
        <p>
          새로운 프로젝트나 협업 기회에 대해 언제든 연락주세요.<br>
          더 나은 서비스를 만들기 위해 함께 고민하고 싶습니다.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="contact-info">
        <div class="contact-item">
          <div class="contact-icon">📧</div>
          <div class="contact-details">
            <h4>Email</h4>
            <a href="mailto:icemoka@kakao.com">icemoka@kakao.com</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="contact-item">
          <div class="contact-icon">📝</div>
          <div class="contact-details">
            <h4>Blog</h4>
            <a href="https://blackcat-dev.kr/" target="_blank">blackcat-dev.kr</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <p>© 2025. Lee Ho Jin. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .contact-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-text {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .contact-text h3 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #2c2c2c;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .contact-text p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #666;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .contact-info {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .contact-item {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
  }

  .contact-item:hover {
    border-color: #f9c51d;
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .contact-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    min-width: 50px;
  }

  .contact-details {
    text-align: left;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .contact-details h4 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #2c2c2c;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  .contact-details a {
    color: #666;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .contact-details a:hover {
    color: #f9c51d;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .contact-cta {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .btn-large {
    padding: 15px 40px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .footer {
    background: #2c2c2c;
    color: #999;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 30px 0;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .footer p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-info {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    
    .contact-item {
      padding: 25px;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .contact-details {
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .contact-text h3 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>